('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000349', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "Precise prepositions and formal email phrases both matter at the B2 level. Someone can be responsible for a project or have access to a system, and a professional email often opens with ''I am writing to'' and always deserves a careful proofread. Academic verbs like ''demonstrate'' and adjectives like ''significant'' help writers sound precise and objective.", "translation": "Preposições precisas e frases formais de e-mail importam no nível B2. Alguém pode ser responsible for um projeto ou ter access to um sistema, e um e-mail profissional geralmente começa com ''I am writing to'' e sempre merece um proofread cuidadoso. Verbos acadêmicos como ''demonstrate'' e adjetivos como ''significant'' ajudam escritores a soar precisos e objetivos.", "question": "What does a professional email always deserve, according to the text?", "options": ["A short subject line", "A careful proofread", "An informal tone"], "correct_index": 1}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000349', 'listening', 12, '{"audio_text": "She is responsible for the entire marketing budget. All employees now have access to the new system. Always proofread important emails before sending them.", "question": "What do all employees now have access to, according to the audio?", "options": ["The marketing budget", "The new system", "A handout"], "correct_index": 1}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000349', 'dictation', 13, '{"audio_text": "I am writing to confirm our meeting tomorrow.", "expected": "I am writing to confirm our meeting tomorrow."}'),
