('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000350', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "This final review brings together idioms and environmental vocabulary from across the B2 level. A simple joke can break the ice, even though some solutions to reduce a company''s carbon footprint cost an arm and a leg. By the time most businesses understood the importance of sustainability, it was already time to take action. Congratulations on completing B2 — the C1 level awaits!", "translation": "Esta revisão final reúne idioms e vocabulário ambiental de todo o nível B2. Uma piada simples pode quebrar o gelo, mesmo que algumas soluções para reduzir a pegada de carbono de uma empresa custem os olhos da cara. Quando a maioria das empresas entendeu a importância da sustentabilidade, já era hora de agir. Parabéns por completar o B2 — o nível C1 espera por você!", "question": "According to the text, what happened by the time most businesses understood sustainability?", "options": ["It was already time to take action", "Costs went down", "The ice was broken"], "correct_index": 0}'),
